{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Evw6dRMArLkvtUWYH7pSvu","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"AAAI 2026 review form scoring criteria rating scale\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"AAAI-26 Review Process Update: Scale, Integrity Measures, and Pathways to Sustainability - AAAI\",\"url\":\"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/review-process-update/\"},{\"title\":\"Instructions for AAAI-26 Reviewers - AAAI\",\"url\":\"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/instructions-for-aaai-26-reviewers/\"},{\"title\":\"Overview of the AI Review System\",\"url\":\"https://aaai.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/FAQ-for-the-AI-Assisted-Peer-Review-Process-Pilot-Program.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"AAAI 2025 Statistics - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/aaai-statistics/aaai-2025-statistics/\"},{\"title\":\"AAAI-26 Review Process - AAAI\",\"url\":\"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/review-process/\"},{\"title\":\"AAAI 2026 Statistics - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/aaai-statistics/aaai-2026-statistics/\"},{\"title\":\"AI-Assisted Peer Review at Scale: The AAAI-26 AI Review Pilot\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/html/2604.13940v1\"},{\"title\":\"AAAI 2026 First-Round Results: High Scores Rejected, AI Reviews Useful? | CSPaper Forum\",\"url\":\"https://forum.cspaper.org/topic/154/aaai-2026-first-round-results-high-scores-rejected-ai-reviews-useful\"},{\"title\":\"AAAI 2026 | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=AAAI.org%2F2026\"},{\"title\":\"AAAI Statistics - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/aaai-statistics/\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found some relevant information about AAAI 2026, though the specific review form scoring criteria and rating scale details were not fully displayed in the search results. Here's what I can share:\n\nAAAI 2026 adopted a hybrid review system with three human reviewers plus one AI-generated review. However, regarding the scoring criteria, the AI review will NOT provide any scores, ratings, or recommendations, with the AI review intended to be factual, following the same guidelines given to human reviewers.\n\nThe search results point to official pages like \"Instructions for AAAI-26 Reviewers\" and \"AAAI-26 Review Process,\" but the specific detailed content about the rating scale and scoring criteria wasn't fully accessible in the search results provided.\n\nFor comprehensive details on the specific review form scoring criteria and rating scale used by human reviewers at AAAI 2026, I recommend:\n1. Visiting the official AAAI-26 Reviewers Instructions page directly at aaai.org\n2. Checking the OpenReview platform for AAAI 2026\n3. Reviewing the AAAI-26 Review Process page for complete guidelines\n\nWould you like me to search for more specific information about any aspect of the AAAI 2026 review process?\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0e774981-e04a-44b5-ae6c-e426561826f8","uuid":"f25df7e0-001e-4c98-b832-44a24c6c4522","timestamp":"2026-05-13T17:51:42.876Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"AAAI 2026 review form scoring criteria rating scale","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_016TiKtwQMxQJbZJg5HwE8sS","content":[{"title":"AAAI-26 Review Process Update: Scale, Integrity Measures, and Pathways to Sustainability - AAAI","url":"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/review-process-update/"},{"title":"Instructions for AAAI-26 Reviewers - AAAI","url":"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/instructions-for-aaai-26-reviewers/"},{"title":"Overview of the AI Review System","url":"https://aaai.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/FAQ-for-the-AI-Assisted-Peer-Review-Process-Pilot-Program.pdf"},{"title":"AAAI 2025 Statistics - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/aaai-statistics/aaai-2025-statistics/"},{"title":"AAAI-26 Review Process - AAAI","url":"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/review-process/"},{"title":"AAAI 2026 Statistics - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/aaai-statistics/aaai-2026-statistics/"},{"title":"AI-Assisted Peer Review at Scale: The AAAI-26 AI Review Pilot","url":"https://arxiv.org/html/2604.13940v1"},{"title":"AAAI 2026 First-Round Results: High Scores Rejected, AI Reviews Useful? | CSPaper Forum","url":"https://forum.cspaper.org/topic/154/aaai-2026-first-round-results-high-scores-rejected-ai-reviews-useful"},{"title":"AAAI 2026 | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=AAAI.org%2F2026"},{"title":"AAAI Statistics - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/aaai-statistics/"}]},"Based on the search results, I found some relevant information about AAAI 2026, though the specific review form scoring criteria and rating scale details were not fully displayed in the search results. Here's what I can share:\n\nAAAI 2026 adopted a hybrid review system with three human reviewers plus one AI-generated review. However, regarding the scoring criteria, the AI review will NOT provide any scores, ratings, or recommendations, with the AI review intended to be factual, following the same guidelines given to human reviewers.\n\nThe search results point to official pages like \"Instructions for AAAI-26 Reviewers\" and \"AAAI-26 Review Process,\" but the specific detailed content about the rating scale and scoring criteria wasn't fully accessible in the search results provided.\n\nFor comprehensive details on the specific review form scoring criteria and rating scale used by human reviewers at AAAI 2026, I recommend:\n1. Visiting the official AAAI-26 Reviewers Instructions page directly at aaai.org\n2. Checking the OpenReview platform for AAAI 2026\n3. Reviewing the AAAI-26 Review Process page for complete guidelines\n\nWould you like me to search for more specific information about any aspect of the AAAI 2026 review process?"],"d