{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FE8oHsZXWVz6eBgZMBoXx1","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"AAAI 2027 2026 reviewer guidelines review form\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"AAAI-26 Review Process - AAAI\",\"url\":\"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/review-process/\"},{\"title\":\"Instructions for AAAI-26 Reviewers - AAAI\",\"url\":\"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/instructions-for-aaai-26-reviewers/\"},{\"title\":\"AAAI-26 Submission Instructions - AAAI\",\"url\":\"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/submission-instructions/\"},{\"title\":\"Ethical Guidelines for AAAI-26 Reviewers - AAAI\",\"url\":\"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/ethical-guidelines-for-aaai-26-reviewers/\"},{\"title\":\"Overview of the AI Review System\",\"url\":\"https://aaai.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/FAQ-for-the-AI-Assisted-Peer-Review-Process-Pilot-Program.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Main Technical Track: Call for Papers - AAAI\",\"url\":\"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/main-technical-track-call/\"},{\"title\":\"ICWSM 2026: Submit\",\"url\":\"https://www.icwsm.org/2026/submit.html\"},{\"title\":\"AAAI 2026 | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=AAAI.org%2F2026\"},{\"title\":\"AAAI-26 Review Process Update: Scale, Integrity Measures, and Pathways to Sustainability - AAAI\",\"url\":\"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/review-process-update/\"},{\"title\":\"AAAI 2026 Conference | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=AAAI.org%2F2026%2FConference\"}]\n\nI found search results related to AAAI-26 (2026) reviewer guidelines and the review process. Here's what the search revealed:\n\n## AAAI-26 Reviewer Resources\n\nThe AAAI website has dedicated pages for reviewer information:\n\n1. **Instructions for AAAI-26 Reviewers** - Available at the AAAI website with detailed guidance for those conducting reviews.\n\n2. **Ethical Guidelines for AAAI-26 Reviewers** - All persons involved in the evaluation of submissions to the AAAI conference and its associated events are required to adhere to the AAAI ethical review guidelines. Key ethical commitments include:\n   - Striving to be fair, unbiased, and objective in evaluation of submissions and treating all authors with respect while providing constructive feedback in a professional and courteous manner\n   - Disclosing any conflicts of interest that may affect impartiality, and declining invitations if not qualified to review or if objectivity is compromised\n\n3. **Review Process** - Review processes for AAAI-26 implement a pilot program for an AI-Assisted Peer Review System, providing supplementary information in the form of AI-generated reviews and summaries that do not contain ratings or recommendations, visible to assigned reviewers, area chairs, and appropriate Program Committee members.\n\nFor specific reviewer forms and detailed guidelines, you may want to visit the official AAAI-26 website pages directly, particularly the \"Instructions for AAAI-26 Reviewers\" page.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0e774981-e04a-44b5-ae6c-e426561826f8","uuid":"42ebe6a5-7765-4ff2-8861-d99b9ca669f6","timestamp":"2026-05-13T17:51:43.535Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"AAAI 2027 2026 reviewer guidelines review form","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01Qs7PmySadZffBTiSQyxZLy","content":[{"title":"AAAI-26 Review Process - AAAI","url":"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/review-process/"},{"title":"Instructions for AAAI-26 Reviewers - AAAI","url":"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/instructions-for-aaai-26-reviewers/"},{"title":"AAAI-26 Submission Instructions - AAAI","url":"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/submission-instructions/"},{"title":"Ethical Guidelines for AAAI-26 Reviewers - AAAI","url":"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/ethical-guidelines-for-aaai-26-reviewers/"},{"title":"Overview of the AI Review System","url":"https://aaai.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/FAQ-for-the-AI-Assisted-Peer-Review-Process-Pilot-Program.pdf"},{"title":"Main Technical Track: Call for Papers - AAAI","url":"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/main-technical-track-call/"},{"title":"ICWSM 2026: Submit","url":"https://www.icwsm.org/2026/submit.html"},{"title":"AAAI 2026 | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=AAAI.org%2F2026"},{"title":"AAAI-26 Review Process Update: Scale, Integrity Measures, and Pathways to Sustainability - AAAI","url":"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/review-process-update/"},{"title":"AAAI 2026 Conference | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=AAAI.org%2F2026%2FConference"}]},"I found search results related to AAAI-26 (2026) reviewer guidelines and the review process. Here's what the search revealed:\n\n## AAAI-26 Reviewer Resources\n\nThe AAAI website has dedicated pages for reviewer information:\n\n1. **Instructions for AAAI-26 Reviewers** - Available at the AAAI website with detailed guidance for those conducting reviews.\n\n2. **Ethical Guidelines for AAAI-26 Reviewers** - All persons involved in the evaluation of submissions to the AAAI conference and its associated events are required to adhere to the AAAI ethical review guidelines. Key ethical commitments include:\n   - Striving to be fair, unbiased, and objective in evaluation of submissions and treating all authors with respect while providing constructive feedback in a professional and courteous manner\n   - Disclosing any conflicts of interest that may affect impartiality, and declining invitations if not qualified to review or if objectivity is compromised\n\n3. **Review Process** - Review processes for AAAI-26 implement a pilot program for an AI-Assisted Peer Review System, providing supplementary information in the form of AI-generated reviews and summaries that do not contain ratings or recommendations, visible to assigned reviewers, area chairs, and appropriate Program Committee members.\n\nFor specific reviewer forms and detailed guidelines, you may want to visit the official AAAI-26 website pages directly, particularly the \"Instructions for AAAI-26 Reviewers\" page."],"durationSeconds":6.279028962000004}}
