{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DLqzrSaDAFZSMyUZMo6LQm","type":"tool_result","content":"# AAAI-26 Reviewer Instructions: Review Form and Scoring Details\n\nThe provided webpage does **not contain** a complete review form, numerical rating scales, scoring criteria, or specific acceptance/rejection guidelines.\n\n## What IS Included:\n\nThe document provides **guidelines on writing helpful reviews**, organized around these evaluation dimensions:\n\n1. **Paper Clarity & Problem Definition**\n   - Problem articulation\n   - State-of-the-art limitations\n   - Claim support from empirical results\n\n2. **Technical Contribution**\n   - Soundness of approach\n   - Description clarity and reproducibility\n   - Limitations disclosure\n\n3. **Related Work Context**\n   - Appropriate placement within existing literature\n\n4. **Evaluation Quality**\n   - Baseline comparisons\n   - Metric appropriateness\n   - Benchmark selection\n   - Error analysis\n   - Replicability\n\n5. **Presentation & Improvement Suggestions**\n\n## What is NOT Included:\n\n- Numerical rating scales (no 1-10 systems defined)\n- Specific score meanings\n- Acceptance/rejection numerical thresholds\n- Formal review form structure\n- Decision categories with point values\n\nThe document emphasizes that \"only the human-written reviews and human expertise will be used\" for Phase 1 decisions, but does not detail the actual scoring mechanism reviewers use to submit these assessments."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0e774981-e04a-44b5-ae6c-e426561826f8","uuid":"2e45c715-9d77-4ce4-9563-2c69aaa1e8ea","timestamp":"2026-05-13T17:51:57.278Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":204307,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# AAAI-26 Reviewer Instructions: Review Form and Scoring Details\n\nThe provided webpage does **not contain** a complete review form, numerical rating scales, scoring criteria, or specific acceptance/rejection guidelines.\n\n## What IS Included:\n\nThe do