{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01MDFpnvLdfR5zxTLKuuiwsK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the key information about AAAI:\n- Acceptance rate: 17.6% (4167/23680)\n- Two-phase review process\n- The specific rating scale isn't publicly available on their website, but based on my knowledge and the AAAI tradition, they use a 1-10 scale\n\nThe AAAI review form (based on my knowledge of AAAI 2025 and earlier years) typically uses:\n- Overall Assessment: 1-10 scale\n  - 10: Award quality\n  - 8-9: Strong accept\n  - 7: Accept\n  - 6: Weak accept\n  - 5: Borderline\n  - 4: Weak reject\n  - 3: Reject\n  - 1-2: Strong reject\n- Confidence: 1-5\n- Dimensions: soundness, significance, novelty, clarity, related work, reproducibility\n\nNow I'll proceed with the review using AAAI standards and dispatch two reviewers in parallel—one focusing on methods and experiments, the other on novelty and related work.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1334,"cache_read_input_tokens":71696,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1334},"output_tokens":11,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0e774981-e04a-44b5-ae6c-e426561826f8","uuid":"008ae029-e8e8-4a8a-a954-3fd6d0323cec"}
