{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Jn5NgT3AmLKePsoy6gCaW9","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-13\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\\\n| exp_004_sim_sweep | 4PL+γ IRT parameter recovery degrades gracefully with exposure signal quality (AUC); there exists a minimum AUC threshold below which γ 95% CI width exceeds 15pp; recovery improves with N_models; prior sensitivity is bounded | — | — | — |\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- exp_001_sft_injection（准备中）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **mvp_sim_confounding** (success): 4PL+γ IRT model can still separate γ from θ when exposure is confounded with ability (corr≈0.4); if not, need model-level random effect for exposure\\\\n- **mvp_sim_4pl_gamma** (success): 4PL+γ IRT model can separate contamination effect (γ) from true ability (θ) on synthetic data; γ posterior recovers true value within ±0.15, θ correlation >0.9\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 2 / 负向 0 / 失败 0 / 共 2\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\ncqa1-21977: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 939, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01J4dchGUbcFNFkwwLmDzJ8P","session_id":"0e774981-e04a-44b5-ae6c-e426561826f8","uuid":"f1e7b871-567a-4ebf-8090-8e43dc69ef1d","timestamp":"2026-05-13T17:53:57.672Z"}
