{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015x4MKeVFiCXXpLNria8oae","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# contamcal-irt-calibration — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-13 17:14 UTC | 更新原因: D006: 投稿目标改回 EMNLP 2026 ARR May 25，12 天冲刺计划\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nContamCal：post-hoc statistical calibration via contamination-augmented 4PL IRT。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 投稿目标\\\\n**EMNLP 2026 ARR May 25**（D006, 距今 12 天）\\\\n- Track: ML for NLP / Resources and Evaluation\\\\n- Special theme: \\\\\\\"New Missions for NLP Research\\\\\\\" — contamination/data governance\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research（MVP 2026-05-13 通过）\\\\n- **exp-004**: subset sweep 运行中（12 conditions × 10 seeds，~8-12h CPU）\\\\n- **论文**: Agent 正在写 Introduction + Method LaTeX 初稿\\\\n- **Dream D2**: re-dream 运行中（dream_20260513T171200），验证 framing/plan 修改\\\\n- **GPU**: 等待用户开服务器（用户承诺充足资源）\\\\n\\\\n## 12 天冲刺计划\\\\n\\\\n### Day 1-2 (May 13-14): 基础设施 + 并行启动\\\\n- [ ] 用户开 GPU 服务器（4+ H100/A100-80G）\\\\n- [x] exp-004 subset sweep 运行中\\\\n- [ ] exp-001 SFT injection 启动（15 runs 并行化到 4 GPU，wall-clock ~13h）\\\\n- [ ] 论文 Introduction + Method 初稿完成\\\\n\\\\n### Day 3-4 (May 15-16): 信号计算\\\\n- [ ] exp-002 信号 pipeline（4 signals on all models）\\\\n- [ ] exp-003 RRF ablation\\\\n- [ ] exp-004 全量 sweep（如 subset 结果 OK）\\\\n- [ ] exp-005 noise propagation\\\\n\\\\n### Day 5-6 (May 17-18): IRT 校准 + 分析\\\\n- [ ] exp-006 IRT calibration + 7 baselines\\\\n- [ ] exp-008 signal survival analysis（P0）\\\\n- [ ] 分析 + 图表生成\\\\n\\\\n### Day 7-8 (May 19-20): 论文 + P1 实验\\\\n- [ ] Paper Agent full draft\\\\n- [ ] exp-007 7B scale-bridging（如 GPU 允许）\\\\n- [ ] exp-009 RL case study（如时间允许）\\\\n- [ ] **Day-8 checkpoint**: behind schedule → cut to MMLU+GSM8K，drop P1\\\\n\\\\n### Day 9-10 (May 21-22): 迭代\\\\n- [ ] Reviewer 审查 + 修改循环\\\\n- [ ] 引用验证（30+ citations）\\\\n- [ ] 图表打磨\\\\n\\\\n### Day 11-12 (May 23-24): 最终提交\\\\n- [ ] Camera-ready polish\\\\n- [ ] ARR submission\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- P0: 90h | P1: 60h | P2: 20h (deferred) | Buffer: 30h\\\\n- 冲刺优先: P0 全跑 + exp-008 (P0) + exp-007/009 (P1, 时间允许)\\\\n- exp-014 (multi-family) 和 P2 推迟到 camera-ready/rebuttal\\\\n\\\\n## 实验优先级（冲刺模式）\\\\n1. exp-001 → exp-002 → exp-003 → exp-006（critical path，~80h GPU）\\\\n2. exp-004, exp-005（CPU，并行）\\\\n3. exp-008（P0，10h GPU）\\\\n4. exp-007（P1，30h GPU，时间允许才跑）\\\\n5. exp-009（P1，15h GPU，时间允许才跑）\\\\n6. exp-014, exp-012, exp-013 → deferred to rebuttal\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D007 | 2026-05-13 | Re-dream gate 从阻塞改为 advisory：D2 结果不再阻塞 P0 实验启动，改为  | — |\\\\n| D006 | 2026-05-13 | 投稿目标改回 EMNLP 2026 ARR May 25（撤销 D001），12 天冲刺 | — |\\\\n| D005 | 2026-05-13 | Dream 审稿分析：best=5/10, median=5/10, worst=4/10。识别 6 | dream_20260513T155040 |\\\\n| D004 | 2026-05-13 | MVP 通过，进入 Research 阶段 | mvp_sim_4pl_gamma, mvp_sim_confounding |\\\\n| D003 | 2026-05-13 | Phase A PASS：4PL+γ 在 N_items=300 下成功分离 γ 和 θ；θ_RMS | mvp_sim_4pl_gamma |\\\\n| D002 | 2026-05-13 | 采纳 Reviewer 3 个 warning：扩展 simulation grid + 加 θ-e | — |\\\\n| D001 | 2026-05-13 | MVP 用 simulation identifiability test 验证 4PL+γ IRT | — |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2695, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01J5ZJzdqAU4b2P7GhF5fHNB","session_id":"0e774981-e04a-44b5-ae6c-e426561826f8","uuid":"3f0d52d3-f86d-4058-bc6d-8541a1141111","timestamp":"2026-05-13T17:54:28.588Z"}
