{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012PELx92rvvEhbEeSAYaJDj","type":"tool_result","content":"1\ttier: best\n2\tnarrative_guidance: '原始framing完全成立。ContamCal作为\"statistical safety net\"在SFT和RL regime下均可靠工作。\n3\t  三条claims无需调整：(1)校准claim以全部4 benchmark × 3 scale × 2 family的显著MAE改进支撑， (2)信号生存claim以清晰的signal×regime\n4\t  AUC heatmap和cliff-like degradation定量支撑， (3)identifiability claim以Fisher Information理论界\n5\t  + 144条件仿真 + 实际数据一致性三重验证。 Headline: \"ContamCal recovers true performance within <2pp\n6\t  MAE with near-nominal CI coverage, while naive scores overestimate by 8-15pp.\" DCR和所有其他baseline被显著beat。\n7\t\n8\t  '\n9\timagined_experiments:\n10\t- name: controlled_sft_injection\n11\t  plan_id: exp-001\n12\t  description: 'Qwen2.5-0.5B/1.5B/3B × 5 dosage levels (0%/5%/25%/50%/100%) × 3 seeds\n13\t    = 45 SFT runs。 72B-Instruct生成paraphrases，BLEU<0.3 + cosine>0.85确保evade n-gram同时保留语义污染。\n14\t\n15\t    '\n16\t  expected_results:\n17\t    mmlu_inflation_0pct_pp: 0.0\n18\t    mmlu_inflation_5pct_pp: 1.8\n19\t    mmlu_inflation_25pct_pp: 5.2\n20\t    mmlu_inflation_50pct_pp: 9.1\n21\t    mmlu_inflation_100pct_pp: 14.3\n22\t    gsm8k_inflation_100pct_pp: 11.7\n23\t    arc_inflation_100pct_pp: 12.4\n24\t    humaneval_inflation_100pct_pp: 8.9\n25\t    paraphrase_cosine_similarity_mean: 0.89\n26\t    paraphrase_bleu_mean: 0.22\n27\t    ngram_decontam_evasion_rate_pct: 97.3\n28\t    inflation_std_across_seeds_pp: 0.6\n29\t    scale_effect_3b_vs_0_5b_ratio: 1.15\n30\t  result_rationale: 'best档下contamination injection完全按预期工作。MMLU作为knowledge-intensive\n31\t    MC benchmark 对paraphrase污染最敏感，100% dosage产生~14pp inflation，与\"Rethinking Benchmark\n32\t    and Contamination\"报告的8-15pp范围上端一致。inflation随dosage严格单调递增——5%仅1.8pp因为 只有~700/14000\n33\t    items被污染，而100%覆盖全部items产生最大效应。GSM8K和ARC略低因为 reasoning benchmarks的contamination效应更依赖solution\n34\t    memorization而非答案记忆。 HumanEval最低(8.9pp)因为N=164且代码生成的paraphrase更难保留原始test case语义。\n35\t    跨seed std仅0.6pp表明injection pipeline高度可复现。3B模型inflation比0.5B略高(1.15×) 因为更大模型有更强的memorization\n36\t    capacity，但差异不大因为SFT均使用相同epoch数。 paraphrase质量指标全部达标：cosine>0.85确保语义等价，BLEU<0.3确保lexical\n37\t    divergence， 97.3% evasion rate验证n-gram decontamination确实无效。\n38\t\n39\t    '\n40\t  tables:\n41\t  - name: 'Table 1: Contamination Inflation (pp) by Benchmark × Dosage × Scale'\n42\t    description: '15行(3 scale × 5 dosage) × 4列(benchmarks)矩阵，每cell为mean±std across\n43\t      3 seeds。 展示inflation严格随dosage单调增长，scale效应存在但secondary。\n44\t\n45\t      '\n46\t  figures_description:\n47\t  - 'Fig 1a: Dose-response curves (dosage% vs inflation pp) per benchmark,分panel by\n48\t    model scale，含error bars。展示严格单调性。'\n49\t  - 'Fig 1b: Paraphrase quality scatter plot (cosine similarity vs BLEU) for 200 sampled\n50\t    pairs，展示high-semantic-low-lexical zone。'\n51\t  analysis: 'injection pipeline的成功是整个ContamCal validation的基础。best档下所有4 benchmarks\n52\t    在所有dosage levels产生statistically significant inflation (5%的p<0.05, 25%+的p<0.001)，\n53\t    为exp-006的ground-truth calibration评估提供了clean/contaminated pairs。 跨scale一致性(std<1pp)意味着calibration结论不受model\n54\t    scale confounding。\n55\t\n56\t    '\n57\t- name: stage1_signal_pipeline\n58\t  plan_id: exp-002\n59\t  description: '对exp-001全部45个contaminated+clean模型计算4个detection signals的per-item exposure\n60\t    scores。\n61\t\n62\t    '\n63\t  expected_results:\n64\t    embedding_retrieval_auc_sft_100pct: 0.88\n65\t    embedding_retrieval_auc_sft_25pct: 0.82\n66\t    embedding_retrieval_auc_sft_5pct: 0.71\n67\t    minkpp_auc_sft_100pct: 0.84\n68\t    minkpp_auc_sft_25pct: 0.76\n69\t    minkpp_auc_sft_5pct: 0.64\n70\t    constat_auc_sft_100pct: 0.81\n71\t    constat_auc_sft_25pct: 0.74\n72\t    constat_auc_sft_5pct: 0.62\n73\t    self_critique_auc_sft_100pct: 0.77\n74\t    self_critique_auc_sft_25pct: 0.7\n75\t    self_critique_auc_sft_5pct: 0.59\n76\t    signal_rank_correlation_across_scales: 0.91\n77\t  result_rationale: 'best档下所有4个signals在SFT regime表现良好。embedding retrieval最强(AUC=0.88\n78\t    at 100%) 因为SFT直接改变了model对contaminated items的internal representation，semantic retrieval\n79\t    能直接捕捉training data与test item的embedding proximity。Min-K%++次之(0.84)因为SFT 显著改变了contaminated\n80\t    items的token-level likelihood分布。ConStat(0.81)通过original vs paraphrased performance\n81\t    gap检测，在paraphrase质量高时信号清晰。Self-Critique最低 (0.77)因为它依赖model的meta-cognitive ability来报告自身对数据的familiarity，在小模型\n82\t    (0.5B)上meta-cognition较弱。所有signals的AUC随dosage下降因为低dosage下被污染items 比例小，signal-to-noise\n83\t    ratio降低。5% dosage时最弱signal(Self-Critique)降至0.59， 接近identifiability边界但仍above chance。跨scale\n84\t    rank correlation 0.91表明signal ranking在不同model sizes间稳定——这对实践者选择signal组合很重要。\n85\t\n86\t    '\n87\t  tables:\n88\t  - name: 'Table 2: Per-Signal AUC by Dosage × Scale'\n89\t    description: '4 signals × 5 dosages × 3 scales的完整AUC矩阵。展示signal hierarchy和dosage敏感性。\n90\t\n91\t      '\n92\t  figures_description:\n93\t  - 'Fig 2: Signal AUC heatmap (signal × dosage)，averaged across scales。颜色从deep blue(0.5)到deep\n94\t    red(0.9)。'\n95\t  analysis: '4个signals提供了互补的contamination detection视角。embedding和Min-K%++依赖model internals\n96\t    (logits/embeddings)，AUC最高但require open weights。ConStat和Self-Critique仅需 behavioral\n97\t    access，AUC较低但applicable to closed-weight models。这个hierarchy在best档下 清晰且一致，为exp-003的RRF\n98\t    aggregation和exp-013的2-signal degraded mode提供了基础。\n99\t\n100\t    '"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01J4dchGUbcFNFkwwLmDzJ8P","session_id":"0e774981-e04a-44b5-ae6c-e426561826f8","uuid":"e1d23b26-d09d-4833-83fa-8bf877b13360","timestamp":"2026-05-13T17:54:45.157Z"}
