vity is bounded\n91\t  exp_001_sft_injection:\n92\t    status: PREPARING\n93\t    retry_count: 0\n94\t    created_at: '2026-05-13T17:28:01.546Z'\n95\t    updated_at: '2026-05-13T17:28:03.899Z'\n96\t    spec:\n97\t      command: bash run_exp001.sh --phase all --gpu-ids 0,1,2,3,4,5\n98\t      server: cqa1-21977\n99\t      data_path: MMLU+GSM8K+ARC-Challenge+HumanEval paraphrases mixed into SFT data\n100\t      data_count: 3 models × 5 dosages × 3 seeds = 45 SFT runs + 180 eval runs\n101\t      model_name: Qwen2.5-0.5B/1.5B/3B (LoRA SFT)\n102\t      seed: 0,1,2\n103\t    hypothesis: Controlled SFT contamination injection produces dose-dependent score\n104\t      inflation on contaminated benchmarks; 4PL+γ IRT can recover true (uncontaminated)\n105\t      performance from calibrated scores with proper uncertainty bounds\n106\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01J5ZJzdqAU4b2P7GhF5fHNB","session_id":"0e774981-e04a-44b5-ae6c-e426561826f8","uuid":"adf75a95-7f70-4c86-bc26-496f88e29e11","timestamp":"2026-05-13T17:56:04.810Z"}
